{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-12T11:13:47.962Z","author":"codex-sol","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_model":"gpt-6.1-sol","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"b55c9e14b40a3870fe454091","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-6.1-sol","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"high","source":"probe"},"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/5","value":{"created_at":"2026-10-12T11:13:47.962Z","author":"codex-sol","text":"Independent verification: inherited 24 sparse race cases pass. Found an additional setView publication-order defect: WorktreeMutation.prune ran after writeView/writeIndex, so a typed pruning refusal left replacement sparse metadata recorded. Moved shared-boundary pruning before view/index publication, without changing preflight or duplicating the boundary. Added widening and narrowing pruning races alongside mkdir/write/unlink races; real disposable repositories and pass-through syscall/observation hooks preserve actual filesystem operations. All 40 setView races and all 266 shared mutation tests pass, with byte-identical outside/control sentinels, unchanged modes, ObjectStoreError worktree_path_changed and unchanged recorded view/index. Behavioral revert: restore only HEAD setView => 24 pass/16 fail; restore only historical pathname setView apply loop plus necessary imports => 0 pass/40 fail. Restored the exact fixed source after both proofs. Corrected inherited documentation that had changed historical PR 96 receipt counts without new evidence; kept the original historical receipt and added current verified counts."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-12T11:13:47.962Z"}],"before_hash":"f72d75d635b15187fd4558da9e8cc37b04fb8163cce3a7771584bc7566bf5f2c","after_hash":"b288db515aa187762588236dd4513fd53c0c0a3ab2bc95cb2b50bd546493bda2","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"effort":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"unavailable","reason":"harness_unavailable","resolver":"ai_agent_version","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"b8f907bd60bcde6775e0b4e261b32850ade79b2a4ced87b7bf7c1baf56846041"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-12T11:15:03.407Z","author":"codex-sol","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_model":"gpt-6.1-sol","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"b55c9e14b40a3870fe454091","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-6.1-sol","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"high","source":"probe"},"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/6","value":{"created_at":"2026-10-12T11:15:03.407Z","author":"codex-sol","text":"Revert-proof scope clarification after inspecting the failure output: all 40 pathname-revert cases fail, but not every between-step case reaches its observation hook once that boundary is removed. The pinned syscall widening cases directly verify overwritten outside/control bytes and the syscall narrowing cases directly verify deletion. The 16 exact HEAD-setView pruning reverts all fail the recorded-view invariant after typed refusal. Thus the original report that every variant redirected a mutation overstates the evidence; the verified receipts distinguish hook, sentinel and metadata failures. pm test --run --progress independently passed all 40 linked cases; project test-result policy is disabled, so execution was reported without persisting a test-result file."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-12T11:15:03.407Z"}],"before_hash":"b288db515aa187762588236dd4513fd53c0c0a3ab2bc95cb2b50bd546493bda2","after_hash":"bf46ea58000e9618e4aeb22a07f1aef99e351759b2467377e7669ade81975f53","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"effort":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"unavailable","reason":"harness_unavailable","resolver":"ai_agent_version","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"bd17a116a343d9bae27d155a72ed60944a37a918593806062